{{Armor Levels|BotW|Hylian Hood}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Descriptions TotK}}
{{Stub|TotK}}
The Hylian Hood can be purchased from [[Mubs]]'s [[Armor Shop]] at [[Lookout Landing]]. After the mayoral election in [[Hateno Village]], [[Link]] can speak to [[Cece]] to customize the Hylian Hood by wearing it down.

