==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
The Hylian Hood is a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]] and is obtained by completing the [[Scenario]] "[[Freeing Korok Forest]]". It can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].
